  lines:
  - Hey, you, you're finally awake
  - Press W to walk up
  - Press A to walk left
  - Press S to walk down
  - Press D to walk right
  - Press SPACE to dash.
  - Left Click to Melee Attack
  - Right Click to Range Attack.
  - Press E to Interact.
  - 'Come find me in the forest. '
